{
  "abstract": "For every prime p, p | M(p−2) iff p ≡ 1 (mod 3), and M(p−2) ≡ −1 (mod p) when p ≡ 5 (mod 6). Conjectured by Serge Batalov (2022) for p ≡ 1 (mod 6); proved by Rob Burns (2017) and Nadav Kohen (2024).",
